@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container mt-5">
    <h1 class="text-center" style="color: #2c3e50; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

    <div class="mt-4">
        <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you use our services. Please read this policy carefully.</p>
        
        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">1. Information We Collect</h3>
        <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">We collect various types of information, including:</p>
        <ul style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">
            <li>Personal identification details (e.g., name, email address, phone number).</li>
            <li>Health-related data (if applicable).</li>
            <li>Usage data (e.g., time spent on the site, pages visited).</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">2. How We Use Your Information</h3>
        <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">
            <li>To provide and improve our services.</li>
            <li>To communicate with you about updates and services.</li>
            <li>To ensure the security and functionality of our platform.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">3. Data Security</h3>
        <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">We implement a variety of security measures to maintain the safety of your personal information. This includes encryption and access control measures to protect against unauthorized access, alteration, or disclosure.</p>

        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">4. Sharing Your Information</h3>
        <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. However, we may share your information with trusted service providers to facilitate the operation of our services.</p>

        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">5. Your Rights</h3>
        <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information at any time. If you wish to exercise these rights, please contact us using the information provided below.</p>

        <h3 style="color: #2c3e50; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">6. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h3>
        <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will post the revised policy on this page and update the "Last Updated" date at the bottom of this policy.</p>

        <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">If you have any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact us at <a href="mailto:hospitalinfo@gmail.com" style="color: #007bff;">hospitalinfo@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <footer class="text-center mt-5" style="color: #7f8c8d; font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;">
        <p>Last Updated: April 2025</p>
    </footer>
</div>
